name 'thinking-critically-about-ai-postassessment-q2_2026-pilot_2026'

question 'An AI image generator produces a realistic-looking photo of a public figure saying something they never actually said. Which concept from this unit does this BEST illustrate?'

wrong 'Hidden AI, because the image was created without the public figure\'s knowledge.'
right 'The gap between how convincing an AI output looks and whether it is actually accurate or truthful.'
wrong 'Responsible co-creation, because a human and AI worked together to make the image.'
wrong 'Data privacy, because the public figure\'s likeness was used without permission to train the model.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

